{
 "encounter_id": "00829",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. Um, I'm back about the pain in my chest, when I breathe. I had that chest infection last month, and the pain didn't go with it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Tell me about the pain. Where is it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "On the right, low down, at the side. Sharp. It catches when I take a deep breath, or cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you had it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Three weeks. It was worse at first, and it's a bit better now, but it's still there."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or coughing up phlegm? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, and the cough's much less. It's dry."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A little, on the stairs. It's not as bad as before. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, 400 mg, three times a day. For the pain."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No allergies."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any history of lung problems?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Asthma, mild."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 128 over 80, temperature 36.6, oxygen 97 percent, respiratory rate 16.",
   "pause": 15.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Fine? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Fine. Let me listen. Breathe in and out, deep.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's a scratchy sound, a friction rub, at the right base when you breathe in, and the rest of your chest is clear."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What is it? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Together with your history, a recent chest infection, and now sharp pain with breathing, that sound is classic for pleurisy, inflammation of the lining of the lung, after the infection."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is it dangerous? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Usually it settles by itself. But because it's lasted three weeks, I'd like a chest X-ray, to check there's no fluid or anything else."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This week. Carry on with the ibuprofen, but take it with food, and not more than the label says."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Rest when you need to, and don't push exercise until the pain has settled. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the pain gets worse, you become breathless at rest, cough up blood, or get a fever, come back that day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. Thank you. ~"
  }
 ],
